{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117858","id":3449671021,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7Nnc1t","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117858","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117858.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117858.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117858","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117858/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117858/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117858/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/1f4ced1645c773c691ab7641fcc514154bcde65d","number":117858,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"CI: pin 5 unpinned action(s)","user":{"login":"dagecko","id":6371704,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzNzE3MDQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6371704?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dagecko","html_url":"https://github.com/dagecko","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dagecko/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dagecko/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dagecko/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dagecko/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dagecko/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dagecko/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dagecko/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dagecko/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dagecko/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Fix: CI/CD Security Vulnerabilities in GitHub Actions\n\nHi! [Runner Guard](https://github.com/Vigilant-LLC/runner-guard), an open-source\nCI/CD security scanner by [Vigilant Cyber Security](https://www.vigilantdefense.com),\nidentified security vulnerabilities in this repository's GitHub Actions workflows.\n\nThis PR applies automated fixes where possible and reports additional findings\nfor your review.\n\n### Fixes applied (in this PR)\n\n| Rule | Severity | File | Description |\n|------|----------|------|-------------|\n| RGS-007 | high | `.github/workflows/linux_builds.yml` | Pinned 1 third-party action(s) to commit SHA |\n| RGS-007 | high | `.github/workflows/static_checks.yml` | Pinned 2 third-party action(s) to commit SHA |\n| RGS-007 | high | `.github/workflows/web_builds.yml` | Pinned 1 third-party action(s) to commit SHA |\n| RGS-007 | high | `.github/workflows/windows_builds.yml` | Pinned 1 third-party action(s) to commit SHA |\n\n\n### Advisory: additional findings (manual review recommended)\n\nNo additional findings beyond the fixes applied above.\n\n### Why this matters\n\nGitHub Actions workflows that use untrusted input in `run:` blocks, expose\nsecrets inline, or use unpinned third-party actions are vulnerable to\ncode injection, credential theft, and supply chain attacks. These are the same\nvulnerability classes exploited in the [tj-actions/changed-files incident](https://www.vigilantdefense.com/resources/runner-guard)\nand subsequent supply chain attacks, which compromised CI secrets across\nthousands of repositories.\n\n### How to verify\n\nReview the diff — each change is mechanical and preserves workflow behavior:\n- **Expression extraction** (RGS-002/008/014): Moves `${{ }}` expressions from\n  `run:` blocks into `env:` mappings, preventing shell injection\n- **SHA pinning** (RGS-007): Pins third-party actions to immutable commit SHAs\n  (original version tag preserved as comment)\n- **Debug env removal** (RGS-015): Removes `ACTIONS_RUNNER_DEBUG`/`ACTIONS_STEP_DEBUG`\n  which leak secrets in workflow logs\n\nRun `brew install Vigilant-LLC/tap/runner-guard && runner-guard scan .` or install from the\n[repo](https://github.com/Vigilant-LLC/runner-guard) to verify.\n\n---\n\nFound by [Runner Guard](https://github.com/Vigilant-LLC/runner-guard) | Built by [Vigilant Cyber Security](https://www.vigilantdefense.com) | [Learn more](https://www.vigilantdefense.com/resources/runner-guard)\n\nIf this PR is not welcome, just close it -- we won't send another.","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098009,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwMDk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:buildsystem","name":"topic:buildsystem","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":6051509301,"node_id":"LA_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABaLK0NQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/spam","name":"spam","description":"","color":"E94A26","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-03-26T07:48:28Z","updated_at":"2026-03-27T11:58:08Z","closed_at":"2026-03-26T21:22:09Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":null,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"dagecko:runner-guard/fix-ci-security","ref":"runner-guard/fix-ci-security","repo":null,"sha":"1f4ced1645c773c691ab7641fcc514154bcde65d","user":{"login":"dagecko","id":6371704,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzNzE3MDQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6371704?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dagecko","html_url":"https://g